---
import { profile } from '../data/portfolio';
---

<section id="about" class="section about-section">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up">
      <div class="section-num">01 / ABOUT</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The backend engineer for messy, expensive, <span>AI-shaped</span> scale problems.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-layout fade-up" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="about-bio">
        <p class="bio-lead">
          <span class="bio-accent">Database-heavy backend engineer focused on reliability, AI cost, and scale.</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          I have spent 5+ years building revenue-critical systems across subscriptions, payments, experimentation, search, caching, realtime data, LLM workflows, and AI-native developer tooling. The through-line is simple: latency, correctness, and cost all show up in production.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am strongest where product ambition collides with backend reality: transaction scope, query plans, hot keys, event design, rollout controls, LLM routing, eval loops, observability, and the operational path after launch.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have partnered with PMs and data teams on 30+ experiments, from assignment and exposure logging to measurement and rollout decisions.
        </p>
        <p class="bio-closing">
          Payments infra, database performance, LLM systems, MCP workflows, realtime pipelines. Built for production, instrumented for feedback, and owned after launch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-meta">
        <div class="quick-facts">
          <div class="qf-item">
            <span class="qf-label mono">Location</span>
            <span class="qf-value">{profile.location}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="qf-item">
            <span class="qf-label mono">Experience</span>
            <span class="qf-value">5+ Years</span>
          </div>
          <div class="qf-item">
            <span class="qf-label mono">Focus</span>
            <span class="qf-value">Distributed Systems / AI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="qf-item">
            <span class="qf-label mono">Systems</span>
            <span class="qf-value">Payments / LLM / Redis</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-traits">
          <div class="trait-item">
            <span class="trait-icon">⬡</span>
            <span>Turns product goals into backend systems with clear failure modes</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trait-item">
            <span class="trait-icon">⬡</span>
            <span>Partnered with PMs and data teams on experiment design and measurement</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trait-item">
            <span class="trait-icon">⬡</span>
            <span>Owns reliability from DB query shape to on-call runbook</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trait-item">
            <span class="trait-icon">⬡</span>
            <span>Built LLM and agent tooling with cost, latency, eval, and quality constraints</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section { background: transparent; }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    max-width: 980px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 0.96;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .section-title span {
    background: var(--nebula-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(280px, 360px);
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .about-bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .bio-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }

  .bio-accent {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    background: var(--nebula-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .about-bio p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .bio-highlight {
    color: #c77dff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bio-closing {
    font-size: 0.88rem !important;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9) !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(157,78,221,0.4);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .text-highlight {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .quick-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .qf-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .qf-label {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.74);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .qf-value {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-traits {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .trait-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.84);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.055);
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .trait-item:hover {
    background: rgba(157,78,221,0.06);
    border-color: rgba(157,78,221,0.18);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .trait-icon {
    color: var(--nebula-accent);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 0.18em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.35rem;
    }

    .quick-facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
